flow From the catalog to the pickup shelf

box search as Member searches the catalog
box list as Catalog lists every copy
choice shelf as Is a copy on the shelf
box pull as Staff pull the copy
box queue as Member joins the hold queue
box hold as Hold shelf for 7 days

step Search
  say The member searches by title, author, or subject.
  start -> search
  search -> list: search

step Choose
  say The catalog shows each copy with its branch and status.
  list -> shelf: pick a copy

step Pull or wait
  say A copy on the shelf is pulled the same day; when every copy is out, the member waits in line.
  shelf -> pull: on the shelf
  shelf -> queue: all out

step Pick up
  say The copy waits 7 days at the pickup branch and the member gets a notice.
  pull -> hold
  queue -> hold: returned
